<view class="page manage-page"><view class="page-title">好好组织每次相遇。</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在打开活动管理…</view><view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="error-box"><text>{{error}}</text><button class="btn btn-secondary" bindtap="refresh">重新加载</button></view><view wx:elif="{{!isAdmin}}" class="empty"><view class="empty-title">这是运营者的工作台</view><view class="muted">只有获得管理员权限的账号，才能创建和管理活动。</view></view><block wx:else><view wx:if="{{mode === 'demo'}}" class="demo-label">本机演示 · 当前可体验管理员操作，不会发布真实活动</view>
  <view wx:if="{{setupNeeded}}" class="setup-card card"><view class="section-title">先布置好本地社区</view><view class="form-note">设置服务区域后，将创建基础圈子。真实环境从空内容开始。</view><view class="field"><view class="label">城市</view><input class="input" value="{{setupCity}}" data-field="setupCity" bindinput="input" maxlength="30" placeholder="例如：上海" disabled="{{busy}}"/></view><view class="field"><view class="label">片区 · 每行一个</view><textarea class="textarea setup-areas" value="{{setupAreas}}" data-field="setupAreas" bindinput="input" maxlength="500" placeholder="填写首批运营片区" disabled="{{busy}}"/></view><view class="field"><view class="label">运营联系方式 · 必填</view><input class="input" value="{{setupContact}}" data-field="setupContact" bindinput="input" maxlength="100" placeholder="会在反馈与帮助中展示" disabled="{{busy}}"/></view><button class="btn btn-primary wide-button" bindtap="initialize" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">完成社区设置</button></view>
  <block wx:elif="{{!formOpen}}"><view class="management-intro row between"><view><view class="section-title">免费活动</view><view class="small muted">确认场地与安排，再邀请大家。</view></view><button class="new-button btn-primary" bindtap="create">＋ 新建活动</button></view><view wx:if="{{events.length === 0}}" class="empty"><view class="empty-title">第一次相遇，从这里开始</view><view class="muted">为附近的同好安排一个真实、轻松的小活动。</view></view><view wx:for="{{events}}" wx:key="id" class="managed-event card" bindtap="edit" data-id="{{item.id}}"><view class="row between"><text class="event-status">{{item.statusText}}</text><text class="small muted">{{item.attendeeCount}} / {{item.capacity}} 人</text></view><view class="managed-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="event-meta">◷ {{item.timeText}}</view><view class="event-meta">⌖ {{item.location}}</view><view class="edit-hint">{{item.cancelled || item.ended ? '查看信息' : item.started ? '查看 / 取消活动' : '编辑安排 / 取消活动'}} ↗</view></view><button wx:if="{{nextCursor && !loading}}" class="btn btn-ghost" bindtap="loadMore" loading="{{moreBusy}}" disabled="{{moreBusy}}">查看更多活动</button></block>
  <block wx:else><view class="row between form-heading"><view class="section-title">{{editingId ? '编辑活动安排' : '新的小相遇'}}</view><button class="text-button" bindtap="closeForm" disabled="{{busy}}">返回列表</button></view><view wx:if="{{editingCancelled}}" class="closed-note">这次活动已取消，不能继续修改。</view><view wx:elif="{{editingEnded}}" class="closed-note">这次活动已结束，不能修改或取消。</view><view wx:elif="{{editingStarted}}" class="closed-note">活动已开始，不能再修改安排。如需停止活动，可填写原因后取消。</view><view class="event-form card"><view class="field"><view class="label">活动标题</view><input class="input" value="{{title}}" data-field="title" bindinput="input" maxlength="60" placeholder="清楚地说说这次一起做什么" disabled="{{busy || editingLocked}}"/></view><view class="field"><view class="label">活动介绍</view><textarea class="textarea event-description" value="{{description}}" data-field="description" bindinput="input" maxlength="1000" placeholder="介绍流程、参加条件、准备事项与天气变化时的安排。" disabled="{{busy || editingLocked}}"/></view><view class="field"><view class="label">公共集合地点</view><input class="input" value="{{location}}" data-field="location" bindinput="input" maxlength="100" placeholder="具体到可找到的公共集合点" disabled="{{busy || editingLocked}}"/></view><view class="field"><view class="label">开始时间</view><view class="date-row"><picker mode="date" value="{{startDate}}" data-field="startDate" bindchange="pick" disabled="{{busy || editingLocked}}"><view class="input picker-value">{{startDate}} ⌄</view></picker><picker mode="time" value="{{startTime}}" data-field="startTime" bindchange="pick" disabled="{{busy || editingLocked}}"><view class="input picker-value">{{startTime}} ⌄</view></picker></view></view><view class="field"><view class="label">结束时间</view><view class="date-row"><picker mode="date" value="{{endDate}}" data-field="endDate" bindchange="pick" disabled="{{busy || editingLocked}}"><view class="input picker-value">{{endDate}} ⌄</view></picker><picker mode="time" value="{{endTime}}" data-field="endTime" bindchange="pick" disabled="{{busy || editingLocked}}"><view class="input picker-value">{{endTime}} ⌄</view></picker></view></view><view class="field"><view class="label">最多几位参与者</view><input type="number" class="input" value="{{capacity}}" data-field="capacity" bindinput="input" maxlength="3" placeholder="2–100 人" disabled="{{busy || editingLocked}}"/><view wx:if="{{existingCount}}" class="field-hint">已有 {{existingCount}} 人报名，人数上限不可低于此数。</view></view><view class="field"><view class="label">带宠要求</view><picker range="{{policies}}" range-key="name" value="{{policyIndex}}" data-field="policyIndex" bindchange="pick" disabled="{{busy || editingLocked}}"><view class="input picker-value row between"><text>{{policies[policyIndex].name}}</text><text>⌄</text></view></picker></view><view class="field"><view class="label">关联小圈子</view><picker range="{{circles}}" range-key="name" value="{{circleIndex}}" data-field="circleIndex" bindchange="pick" disabled="{{busy || editingLocked}}"><view class="input picker-value row between"><text>{{circles[circleIndex].name}}</text><text>⌄</text></view></picker></view><view class="form-note">首版活动免费。信息变更和取消会通知已报名用户。</view></view><button wx:if="{{!editingLocked}}" class="btn btn-primary wide-button" bindtap="save" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">{{editingId ? '保存活动安排' : '发布免费活动'}}</button><view wx:if="{{editingId && !editingCancelled && !editingEnded}}" class="cancel-form card"><view class="cancel-title">需要取消这次活动？</view><view class="form-note">请说明原因，方便报名者调整安排。</view><textarea class="textarea cancel-input" value="{{cancelReason}}" data-field="cancelReason" bindinput="input" maxlength="80" placeholder="填写取消原因（最多 80 字）" disabled="{{busy}}"/><button class="cancel-button" bindtap="cancelEvent" disabled="{{busy}}">取消活动并通知报名者</button></view></block></block></view>
